# The repo-root .gitignore drops all *.csv and *.rds. Re-include the small,
# non-regenerable-cheaply model artifacts we DO want versioned (coefficients, metrics,
# tuning, feasibility, and the lightweight glmnet fits)...
!*.csv
!*.rds
# ...but keep the large per-obs predictions out of git.
*_oof_predictions.csv
# ...and the time-series diagnostic cache (scripts/ts_plot_cache.R) - large, regenerable,
# would otherwise be swept back in by the !*.rds re-include above.
ts_plot_cache_v*.rds
# Per-fire diagnostic PNGs (scripts/ts_plot_by_fire.R) are derived/regenerable too.
prediction_plots/
